{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30008_01_f",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:ee93fc36a4c8b9dc3143ab0d1fab473a69d1da9fc3720eb40c33502123f41440",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_f:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:473e639a573c861243a8ca61234d048c0361b83e8f73bf7e7897894c78439fcf",
      "text": "确实，蛋糕也很适合用来补充糖分啦。\n但我觉得果然还是甜甜圈更胜一筹啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_f:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e835b6e94dc2b3db3ff01fc39465e0a891e3b18da6ba7ce37a3b0a952175711f",
      "text": "不管在什么时候，只要吃一口甜甜圈，\n就会打起精神对吧？所以第一名非甜甜圈莫属！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_f:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fb444a80a786333748fdee2a551b67606eb1b76077763ae8c331b5329f5d7d0",
      "text": "既然这么说，那我认为是蛋糕。蛋糕无论是\n特别的纪念日还是平凡的日常，总能给人带来快乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_f:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f2b81c57031c1567fc435e413bdcf73cb81e70b86a9ed035f4ea66123ed92d9",
      "text": "别别别，甜甜圈也是一样的好吧！\n所以说，这种时候就该吃甜甜圈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_f:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60c4799e3ffc650ead40bd497a8048dfebc5cb68230670437abf7faa3c675de3",
      "text": "不，是蛋糕！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_f:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8492f15f65eefd9a514dc18f1b9ec87b0e93ed7630f04b1b00a45d45500ceca5",
      "text": "哎呀～怎么感觉有点要吵起来了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_f:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0011799f3957619c360b8071a465ec340e3d96a3e47b39b85ede14745ac48c48",
      "text": "这样下去可不行呢。\n在下是否应该上前劝阻……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_f:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e75626bc6f721860edf64fb890fea29b000932a83e5c806b9ee1465b00d66f4",
      "text": "No problem啦，Mr. 清澄！\n他们两个只是在discussion而已啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_f:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:458ef6365e7e0396f579f2813b4f42a5686cd929f1f5593a6bb79a51433e83af",
      "text": "有时候像那样好好聊聊也很重要哦。\n而且把话说开了，感情反而会更好呢☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_f:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5c336021eb2ae167c1874ee85091dafb4f97818f539d81e9f768e29277c6ae5",
      "text": "是、是这样吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_f:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:728f97d591eb815851613ee952628b3f9e6a2975b5a6d56352a84c53bd056a22",
      "text": "甜甜圈的种类那么丰富对吧？\n而且拿起来就能轻松吃掉，这点很棒啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_f:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f1fa4c2b42765cb7570538bd776853573957b546514182575458bdb1bce98a1",
      "text": "那蛋糕也是一样的啊。\n不论专卖店还是便利店，哪里都能买到！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_f:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:165951659b426b63aa071b3251f68e10bd5cfbdd5917e0684f9ba69a9076e92b",
      "text": "……呼。看样子光靠我们两个讨论，\n是很难讨论出答案了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_f:cmd-000158:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f41c560bb6128e34968ee3abb4aa200fea46b9652381a589f42c6f6dc79b944",
      "text": "说的也是。那就听听大家的意见吧。\n所以说制作人，你觉得哪边更好？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
